[
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Day ten.",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 0.904
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "The ground shakes.",
"start": 1.058,
"end": 2.152
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Dirt pours from the ceiling of your tunnel.",
"start": 2.375,
"end": 4.842
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Outside, the sky is on fire.",
"start": 5.15,
"end": 7.305
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "And at the door, something too big to fit inside is breathing.",
"start": 7.612,
"end": 12.569
},
{
"chunk": 2,
"text": "Ten days ago, you were asleep in your own bed.",
"start": 13.867,
"end": 17.037
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You have 10 days before the asteroid that killed the dinosaurs.",
"start": 17.375,
"end": 20.836
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "Every big animal you see will die.",
"start": 21.142,
"end": 23.475
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You won't.",
"start": 23.632,
"end": 24.368
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "If you stay small.",
"start": 24.676,
"end": 25.804
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The night before was like any other.",
"start": 28.256,
"end": 30.365
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "Homework, a documentary about the dinosaurs, your phone at 23%.",
"start": 30.673,
"end": 35.518
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "\"I'll charge it in the morning.\"",
"start": 35.826,
"end": 37.3
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "In your backpack, ready for school: two textbooks, a sandwich, two chocolate bars, half a bottle of water.",
"start": 37.608,
"end": 44.685
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "And a library book you wanted to read in the break tomorrow.",
"start": 44.992,
"end": 47.749
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The Last Day of the Dinosaurs.",
"start": 48.057,
"end": 50.546
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "In the morning, there's no ceiling.",
"start": 50.884,
"end": 52.77
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "There are leaves, each one bigger than your bed.",
"start": 53.027,
"end": 55.84
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The air is hot and wet.",
"start": 56.148,
"end": 57.688
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No cars.",
"start": 57.8,
"end": 58.481
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No voices.",
"start": 58.548,
"end": 59.463
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "Next to you, something rises from the ground like a tree trunk.",
"start": 59.771,
"end": 62.875
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It isn't a tree.",
"start": 63.728,
"end": 64.8
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It has claws.",
"start": 65.408,
"end": 66.49
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The foot lifts, slams down one step ahead, and the ground jumps under you.",
"start": 66.792,
"end": 72.541
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "You don't breathe until the footsteps fade.",
"start": 72.849,
"end": 76.03
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your backpack is lying next to you.",
"start": 76.366,
"end": 78.376
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your phone is still in your pocket.",
"start": 78.677,
"end": 80.519
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No signal.",
"start": 80.827,
"end": 81.675
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No internet.",
"start": 81.832,
"end": 82.713
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Just one message that wasn't there last night.",
"start": 82.825,
"end": 85.549
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "\"Impact: 10 days.",
"start": 85.857,
"end": 87.554
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "3,000 kilometers south.\"",
"start": 87.711,
"end": 89.486
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A prank.",
"start": 89.639,
"end": 90.376
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A dream.",
"start": 90.532,
"end": 91.28
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "It has to be.",
"start": 91.325,
"end": 92.274
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "You switch it off at 22%, and you start walking.",
"start": 92.582,
"end": 95.964
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "All afternoon, you look for a road, a wire, a plane in the sky.",
"start": 96.3,
"end": 100.497
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Anything.",
"start": 100.654,
"end": 101.39
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "There's nothing.",
"start": 101.544,
"end": 102.415
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "In the evening, you find the owner of the foot.",
"start": 102.723,
"end": 105.044
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "A T.",
"start": 105.201,
"end": 105.613
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 105.659,
"end": 106.206
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "12 meters, nose to tail, with a long pale scar across its snout.",
"start": 106.513,
"end": 111.146
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "For one second, its head turns toward you.",
"start": 111.454,
"end": 113.987
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Then it walks on.",
"start": 114.212,
"end": 115.762
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 117.018,
"end": 118.246
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "That night you squeeze in between the roots of a giant tree.",
"start": 118.584,
"end": 121.977
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You're shaking.",
"start": 122.167,
"end": 123.083
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't want to sleep.",
"start": 123.138,
"end": 124.299
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "In the dark, you open your backpack, looking for anything that makes sense.",
"start": 124.607,
"end": 129.138
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "The library book.",
"start": 129.446,
"end": 130.64
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the cover, a T.",
"start": 130.948,
"end": 132.478
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "rex skeleton in a museum.",
"start": 132.512,
"end": 134.375
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't look closely.",
"start": 134.554,
"end": 135.983
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Inside, chapter seven.",
"start": 136.29,
"end": 138.065
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Who Survived.",
"start": 138.219,
"end": 139.202
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that were small.",
"start": 139.51,
"end": 140.894
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that hid underground.",
"start": 141.202,
"end": 142.842
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that lived near fresh water.",
"start": 143.15,
"end": 145.315
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the back page, with your school pen, you write a plan.",
"start": 145.623,
"end": 148.77
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Three things.",
"start": 150.664,
"end": 151.446
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Ten days.",
"start": 151.6,
"end": 152.348
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "None of them done.",
"start": 152.649,
"end": 153.598
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't decide to fall asleep.",
"start": 153.906,
"end": 155.525
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Your body decides for you.",
"start": 155.748,
"end": 158.104
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "In the morning, there's a small hole by the roots.",
"start": 158.969,
"end": 161.648
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "A furry face pokes out.",
"start": 161.805,
"end": 163.546
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 163.854,
"end": 164.758
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Sniffs.",
"start": 164.892,
"end": 165.528
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Disappears.",
"start": 165.718,
"end": 166.578
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "You name him Pip.",
"start": 166.886,
"end": 168.851
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 169.188,
"end": 169.589
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "rex needs mountains of meat every day.",
"start": 169.645,
"end": 171.811
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Pip needs a few seeds and a hole to hide in.",
"start": 172.118,
"end": 174.608
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "And your book agrees.",
"start": 174.915,
"end": 176.355
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Scientists think that after the impact, almost no land animal heavier than about 25 kilograms survived.",
"start": 176.662,
"end": 183.461
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "You weigh 70.",
"start": 184.314,
"end": 185.811
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "So you'll have to think like Pip.",
"start": 186.067,
"end": 187.753
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Rule one: stay small.",
"start": 188.061,
"end": 190.606
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat half the sandwich.",
"start": 190.943,
"end": 192.506
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You save the rest.",
"start": 192.562,
"end": 193.667
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Then you watch what Pip eats.",
"start": 193.975,
"end": 195.94
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Small red berries, seeds from one kind of fern.",
"start": 196.248,
"end": 199.262
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "That's no guarantee.",
"start": 199.57,
"end": 200.742
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Plenty of things a mouse can eat would kill you.",
"start": 200.832,
"end": 202.963
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "But he's a mammal, like you, and the sandwich won't last.",
"start": 203.271,
"end": 206.542
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat one berry.",
"start": 206.85,
"end": 207.944
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You wait.",
"start": 207.988,
"end": 208.613
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "By evening, nothing has happened.",
"start": 208.921,
"end": 210.775
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You fill your pockets.",
"start": 211.083,
"end": 212.768
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Day three.",
"start": 213.345,
"end": 214.238
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "The bottle is empty.",
"start": 214.495,
"end": 215.622
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Your throat is burning.",
"start": 215.689,
"end": 216.951
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "You follow the sound of water to a wide, muddy river.",
"start": 217.259,
"end": 220.73
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "At the edge, a log is floating.",
"start": 221.037,
"end": 223.013
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It blinks.",
"start": 223.957,
"end": 224.76
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It isn't a log.",
"start": 225.613,
"end": 226.618
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It's a crocodile.",
"start": 226.674,
"end": 228.449
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "So you don't drink from the river.",
"start": 228.786,
"end": 230.46
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "A few steps back from the bank, in the sand, you dig a pit and wait.",
"start": 230.767,
"end": 235.065
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Water seeps in through the sand.",
"start": 235.373,
"end": 237.304
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 237.612,
"end": 238.27
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Muddy.",
"start": 238.424,
"end": 239.138
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "But cleaner than the river, and far from the teeth.",
"start": 239.446,
"end": 242.214
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You fill the bottle.",
"start": 242.522,
"end": 243.672
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "In the shallow pools, small fish are trapped.",
"start": 243.98,
"end": 246.882
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You catch three and dry them on a hot rock.",
"start": 247.189,
"end": 249.701
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "No fire needed.",
"start": 250.009,
"end": 251.191
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "It's warm here, almost tropical, even at night.",
"start": 251.499,
"end": 254.312
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "From now on, every morning starts at the pools.",
"start": 254.619,
"end": 257.255
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "The book says freshwater animals, turtles, frogs, even crocodiles, made it through far better than most.",
"start": 258.997,
"end": 264.947
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Rule two: stay near water.",
"start": 265.255,
"end": 268.112
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Day four.",
"start": 268.977,
"end": 269.848
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The ground shakes again.",
"start": 270.156,
"end": 271.518
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Not one footstep.",
"start": 271.608,
"end": 272.802
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Hundreds.",
"start": 272.958,
"end": 273.594
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A herd of duck-billed dinosaurs comes along the river.",
"start": 273.902,
"end": 277.34
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Then a deep sound rolls in from far away.",
"start": 277.648,
"end": 280.216
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You feel it in your chest more than your ears.",
"start": 280.524,
"end": 283.091
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The herd panics.",
"start": 283.399,
"end": 284.728
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Trees snap.",
"start": 284.862,
"end": 285.888
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You throw yourself behind a fallen log.",
"start": 286.196,
"end": 288.462
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "When the dust settles, one of them didn't get up.",
"start": 288.77,
"end": 290.946
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "And it has something you need.",
"start": 291.254,
"end": 292.65
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A shoulder blade.",
"start": 292.706,
"end": 293.598
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Flat.",
"start": 293.655,
"end": 294.089
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Wide.",
"start": 294.157,
"end": 294.714
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The size of a paddle.",
"start": 294.827,
"end": 296.01
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "From today, your shovel is a dinosaur.",
"start": 296.317,
"end": 299.019
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Day five.",
"start": 299.596,
"end": 300.478
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "You read the page you've been avoiding.",
"start": 300.786,
"end": 302.538
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Within an hour of the impact, burning debris falls back through the sky, all over the world.",
"start": 302.846,
"end": 308.874
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Scientists still argue about how hot it got.",
"start": 309.182,
"end": 312.251
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "In many places, hot enough to set forests on fire.",
"start": 312.559,
"end": 315.718
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "On the surface, there's nowhere to hide.",
"start": 316.026,
"end": 318.113
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Under a meter of soil, maybe.",
"start": 318.421,
"end": 320.152
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Rule three: stay underground.",
"start": 320.46,
"end": 323.552
},
{
"chunk": 16,
"text": "You find a clay bank above the river and start digging.",
"start": 323.888,
"end": 327.371
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "Now the math.",
"start": 327.708,
"end": 328.868
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "With a bone, in clay, a cave big enough to crouch in grows about 30 centimeters a day.",
"start": 329.176,
"end": 335.372
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "To get a meter of soil over your head, you have to go two and a half meters in.",
"start": 335.68,
"end": 339.821
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "That's eight days of work.",
"start": 340.129,
"end": 341.759
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "The asteroid hits on day ten.",
"start": 342.066,
"end": 343.919
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "You have five.",
"start": 344.227,
"end": 345.432
},
{
"chunk": 18,
"text": "You dig until it's too dark to see, then sleep in the mud by the hole.",
"start": 345.768,
"end": 351.394
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Day six.",
"start": 351.972,
"end": 352.81
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Your hands are blistered.",
"start": 353.066,
"end": 354.428
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You're in as deep as your arms can reach.",
"start": 354.736,
"end": 356.835
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Then the roof comes down on you.",
"start": 357.688,
"end": 359.809
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You crawl out coughing dirt.",
"start": 360.116,
"end": 362.003
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Everything you dug, gone.",
"start": 362.946,
"end": 364.654
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Four days left.",
"start": 364.877,
"end": 366.005
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Eight days of digging.",
"start": 366.312,
"end": 367.708
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You sit in the mud.",
"start": 368.043,
"end": 369.126
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And there, in the bank next to your ruin, a tiny new hole.",
"start": 369.338,
"end": 373.446
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip followed you to the river.",
"start": 374.445,
"end": 376.141
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "His hole is tiny.",
"start": 376.32,
"end": 377.816
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And it doesn't collapse.",
"start": 378.124,
"end": 379.296
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Because Pip doesn't dig a cave.",
"start": 379.604,
"end": 381.323
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip digs a tunnel exactly as wide as Pip, and one small nest at the end.",
"start": 381.631,
"end": 386.509
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "So you stop digging a cave.",
"start": 386.816,
"end": 388.726
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You dig a tunnel exactly as wide as your shoulders.",
"start": 389.034,
"end": 391.746
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "A quarter of the dirt.",
"start": 392.054,
"end": 393.516
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Four times as fast.",
"start": 393.651,
"end": 395.058
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And you shape the roof into an arch, because an arch pushes the weight into the walls instead of down on you.",
"start": 395.365,
"end": 401.796
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "The entrance faces north, away from where the asteroid will hit.",
"start": 402.104,
"end": 406.591
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Maybe it makes no difference.",
"start": 406.899,
"end": 408.284
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "It feels right.",
"start": 408.316,
"end": 409.311
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 409.464,
"end": 410.313
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Even when you dig.",
"start": 410.469,
"end": 412.379
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "By dark, the tunnel swallows you to the waist.",
"start": 414.302,
"end": 416.914
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "That night you sleep with your head underground and your boots outside.",
"start": 417.222,
"end": 420.683
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "It's a start.",
"start": 420.838,
"end": 422.234
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Day seven.",
"start": 423.099,
"end": 423.947
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Pip doesn't run anymore.",
"start": 424.255,
"end": 425.728
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "He's waiting at the entrance in the morning.",
"start": 425.985,
"end": 427.894
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "You split your last chocolate with him, and you dig.",
"start": 428.202,
"end": 431.127
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "By noon, the blisters have burst.",
"start": 433.021,
"end": 435.242
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Your palms are raw and bleeding into the clay.",
"start": 435.55,
"end": 438.307
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "And you know a hand that breaks today digs nothing tomorrow.",
"start": 438.614,
"end": 441.495
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "So you stop.",
"start": 441.803,
"end": 442.63
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even with three days left.",
"start": 442.937,
"end": 444.3
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even if the end is coming anyway.",
"start": 444.608,
"end": 446.462
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "For one afternoon, you rest.",
"start": 446.55,
"end": 449.062
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 449.399,
"end": 450.571
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Just for a minute.",
"start": 450.661,
"end": 451.52
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "The minute becomes an hour.",
"start": 451.777,
"end": 453.194
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Photos.",
"start": 453.385,
"end": 454.021
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your room.",
"start": 454.175,
"end": 454.923
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your mom in the kitchen.",
"start": 455.224,
"end": 456.419
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends outside school.",
"start": 456.531,
"end": 458.406
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Then a video, from a few months ago.",
"start": 458.713,
"end": 460.767
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "A class trip to a museum.",
"start": 460.801,
"end": 462.375
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You, laughing at the camera, a giant skeleton behind you.",
"start": 462.683,
"end": 466.657
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "\"If they ever sent me back to the dinosaurs?",
"start": 466.964,
"end": 469.542
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "I'd survive.",
"start": 469.733,
"end": 470.704
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Easy.\"",
"start": 470.858,
"end": 471.639
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends laughing behind the phone.",
"start": 471.947,
"end": 474.871
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Why are you here?",
"start": 476.169,
"end": 477.241
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "What happened?",
"start": 477.274,
"end": 478.358
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe you're still asleep.",
"start": 478.659,
"end": 480.032
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe this is all a dream.",
"start": 480.506,
"end": 482.203
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "You look down at your hands.",
"start": 482.511,
"end": 484.196
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "The pain is real.",
"start": 485.139,
"end": 486.334
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 486.752,
"end": 487.968
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "You always said you'd survive.",
"start": 489.267,
"end": 491.142
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Now you have to prove it.",
"start": 492.086,
"end": 493.236
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "When you switch it off, it's at 11%.",
"start": 493.543,
"end": 495.72
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Ten percent, gone on home.",
"start": 495.787,
"end": 497.595
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "It was worth it.",
"start": 498.091,
"end": 499.687
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "That night, you fit all the way inside.",
"start": 500.024,
"end": 502.525
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "You wake up, and Pip is asleep in your jacket pocket.",
"start": 502.833,
"end": 505.913
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Warm.",
"start": 506.221,
"end": 506.891
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Breathing.",
"start": 507.045,
"end": 507.715
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Seven days in a world with no one.",
"start": 508.023,
"end": 510.524
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "And now you have someone.",
"start": 511.635,
"end": 514.045
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Day eight.",
"start": 514.911,
"end": 515.569
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "You dig until your arms shake.",
"start": 515.659,
"end": 517.579
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Two and a half meters.",
"start": 517.887,
"end": 519.115
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "And at the very end, a nest, just big enough to sit up in.",
"start": 519.423,
"end": 523.208
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "A meter of soil over your head.",
"start": 525.102,
"end": 526.922
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "That night, for the first time in eight days, nothing can step on you.",
"start": 527.23,
"end": 532.175
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "At midnight, you wake.",
"start": 533.474,
"end": 534.825
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Scratching at the entrance.",
"start": 535.133,
"end": 536.562
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then sniffing.",
"start": 536.673,
"end": 537.712
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then something coming in.",
"start": 538.019,
"end": 539.56
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "In the dark, two yellow eyes.",
"start": 539.867,
"end": 541.91
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "A feathered hunter.",
"start": 542.021,
"end": 543.071
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Fast.",
"start": 543.261,
"end": 543.919
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Only as tall as your knee.",
"start": 543.997,
"end": 545.515
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Not a T.",
"start": 545.823,
"end": 546.348
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 546.404,
"end": 546.873
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small enough to fit in your tunnel.",
"start": 546.951,
"end": 548.569
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small doesn't mean safe.",
"start": 548.877,
"end": 550.552
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Your headlamp lights it up.",
"start": 550.887,
"end": 552.35
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It doesn't care.",
"start": 552.462,
"end": 553.488
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It lunges.",
"start": 553.985,
"end": 554.889
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Claws rip across your right forearm.",
"start": 555.197,
"end": 557.486
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No knife.",
"start": 557.793,
"end": 558.43
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No fire.",
"start": 558.586,
"end": 559.345
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No room to swing a bone.",
"start": 559.457,
"end": 560.863
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Just one thing this world has never seen.",
"start": 561.716,
"end": 563.972
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 564.28,
"end": 565.452
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "11%.",
"start": 565.474,
"end": 566.367
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You hit the alarm and point the flashlight straight into its face.",
"start": 566.423,
"end": 569.761
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "A sound sixty-six million years too early fills the tunnel.",
"start": 570.068,
"end": 574.11
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It shrieks, and it's gone.",
"start": 574.896,
"end": 576.715
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "But it could come back.",
"start": 577.053,
"end": 578.638
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Blood drips from your arm.",
"start": 578.946,
"end": 580.598
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Pip creeps out of your pocket and sits by your hand.",
"start": 580.906,
"end": 583.753
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "You can't leave the light on.",
"start": 584.061,
"end": 585.456
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "It would be dead in an hour, and dawn is five hours away.",
"start": 585.567,
"end": 589.15
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "So you count.",
"start": 589.307,
"end": 590.457
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Ten seconds of light.",
"start": 590.764,
"end": 592.137
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "One minute of dark.",
"start": 592.445,
"end": 593.606
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Every time the dark comes back, you listen for claws.",
"start": 593.913,
"end": 597.921
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "When the sky turns grey, you switch it off.",
"start": 599.219,
"end": 601.541
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "3%.",
"start": 602.674,
"end": 603.534
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Day nine.",
"start": 604.111,
"end": 604.926
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You have a fever.",
"start": 605.014,
"end": 605.963
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The wound is hot.",
"start": 606.075,
"end": 607.136
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You wrap it in a strip torn from your t-shirt.",
"start": 607.443,
"end": 610.012
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The entrance let a hunter in.",
"start": 610.319,
"end": 612.106
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Tomorrow, it has to keep the whole world out.",
"start": 612.413,
"end": 615.014
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "One-handed, you drag stones up from the river and stack them around the opening.",
"start": 615.322,
"end": 619.52
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Last, a big flat stone.",
"start": 619.828,
"end": 621.637
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "From inside, you can drag it across like a door, and push it aside to get out.",
"start": 621.944,
"end": 626.275
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "When it's closed, it leaves a gap a hand wide.",
"start": 626.583,
"end": 629.508
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Enough for air.",
"start": 629.815,
"end": 630.819
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Not enough for teeth.",
"start": 630.876,
"end": 632.059
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The sun is going down when the door slides into place.",
"start": 632.366,
"end": 635.325
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Just in time.",
"start": 637.219,
"end": 638.18
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Two out of three.",
"start": 638.403,
"end": 639.418
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Twelve dried fish won't last a winter.",
"start": 639.726,
"end": 642.026
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "And you're out of days.",
"start": 642.115,
"end": 644.269
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch the phone on one more time.",
"start": 645.135,
"end": 647.479
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "The message has changed.",
"start": 647.781,
"end": 649.198
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "\"Impact: tomorrow.\"",
"start": 649.506,
"end": 651.113
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch it off.",
"start": 651.421,
"end": 653.062
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "That night you slide the door aside and climb out.",
"start": 653.399,
"end": 656.134
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The sky is full of stars.",
"start": 656.441,
"end": 658.184
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "From across the river comes that low, familiar call.",
"start": 658.491,
"end": 661.684
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The same T.",
"start": 661.991,
"end": 663.008
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 663.052,
"end": 663.677
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The last night of the dinosaurs.",
"start": 663.979,
"end": 665.764
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "And only you know.",
"start": 666.072,
"end": 668.237
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "It isn't a strange morning.",
"start": 668.573,
"end": 670.203
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "That's what makes it strange.",
"start": 670.511,
"end": 672.117
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Birds are singing.",
"start": 672.425,
"end": 673.553
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Insects are buzzing.",
"start": 673.707,
"end": 675.08
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "A few triceratops are drinking across the river.",
"start": 675.387,
"end": 678.235
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "None of them know.",
"start": 678.542,
"end": 680.306
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Then, in the south, a light.",
"start": 680.643,
"end": 682.965
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Not like the sun.",
"start": 683.273,
"end": 684.233
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Like someone switched the sky on by mistake.",
"start": 685.176,
"end": 688.513
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Your book said the shaking comes within minutes.",
"start": 688.85,
"end": 691.596
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It's right.",
"start": 692.539,
"end": 693.231
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The ground starts to move.",
"start": 693.538,
"end": 695.135
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Not like a footstep.",
"start": 695.442,
"end": 696.682
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Like the whole world.",
"start": 696.793,
"end": 697.91
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The river pulls back.",
"start": 698.133,
"end": 699.584
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Then it comes back, the wrong way.",
"start": 699.696,
"end": 702.197
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "A wall of water runs upstream and throws fish onto the bank.",
"start": 702.505,
"end": 706.065
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It climbs up the bank, and stops a hand below your door.",
"start": 706.373,
"end": 710.001
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "When it pulls back, you run down and grab every fish you can carry.",
"start": 710.308,
"end": 714.214
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Food for the dark.",
"start": 715.069,
"end": 716.118
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The last thing on your list.",
"start": 717.772,
"end": 719.546
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The end of the world just handed it to you.",
"start": 719.854,
"end": 722.12
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "This isn't imagination.",
"start": 722.428,
"end": 724.191
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "In North Dakota, scientists found fossil fish with tiny glass beads from this impact stuck in their gills.",
"start": 724.499,
"end": 732.212
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Then those same glass beads start falling from the sky.",
"start": 732.548,
"end": 735.875
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Small and hot, like burning hail.",
"start": 736.183,
"end": 738.885
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "The sky turns red.",
"start": 739.109,
"end": 740.593
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "You drag the door shut, hold Pip tight and crawl to the end of the tunnel.",
"start": 740.901,
"end": 745.02
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Outside, the first trees catch fire.",
"start": 745.327,
"end": 748.229
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "By evening, the whole forest is burning.",
"start": 748.538,
"end": 751.328
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "And then, outside, footsteps.",
"start": 751.663,
"end": 754.041
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Heavy.",
"start": 754.349,
"end": 754.952
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 755.131,
"end": 755.834
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Close.",
"start": 755.987,
"end": 756.579
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Something huge collapses at your door, and its shadow covers the gap.",
"start": 756.887,
"end": 760.816
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 761.124,
"end": 761.537
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 761.593,
"end": 762.107
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "From day one.",
"start": 762.261,
"end": 763.165
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The scar across its snout.",
"start": 763.255,
"end": 764.851
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its huge snout is right against the stones.",
"start": 765.159,
"end": 767.603
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its hot breath fills your tunnel.",
"start": 767.714,
"end": 769.78
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It can't get in.",
"start": 770.511,
"end": 771.482
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It doesn't even try.",
"start": 771.738,
"end": 772.833
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It only came for the cool soil at your door, away from the fire.",
"start": 772.966,
"end": 777.432
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "All night, from the other side of the stones, you hear it breathing.",
"start": 777.769,
"end": 781.654
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "Each breath slower.",
"start": 781.962,
"end": 784.317
},
{
"chunk": 46,
"text": "Until morning.",
"start": 785.614,
"end": 787.177
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "Then it stops.",
"start": 788.476,
"end": 789.637
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "The last dinosaur you saw died at your door.",
"start": 790.58,
"end": 794.04
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "In the days after, the river rises again and buries the T.",
"start": 794.906,
"end": 798.724
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "rex in thick mud.",
"start": 798.757,
"end": 800.153
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "Buried fast in mud.",
"start": 800.461,
"end": 802.09
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "That's how bones become fossils.",
"start": 802.398,
"end": 804.296
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "You open your book to the cover.",
"start": 804.604,
"end": 806.156
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "The museum skeleton.",
"start": 806.289,
"end": 807.64
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "And this time, you look closely.",
"start": 807.797,
"end": 809.661
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "A long scar, healed into the bone of the snout.",
"start": 810.682,
"end": 814.812
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The same skeleton that stood behind you in that video.",
"start": 816.11,
"end": 819.112
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The one you joked in front of.",
"start": 819.369,
"end": 820.965
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "Sixty-six million years from now, it will stand in a museum.",
"start": 821.273,
"end": 824.778
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "And one day, you'll stand in front of it, laughing, with no idea you were here when it died.",
"start": 825.086,
"end": 831.058
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Then the dark comes.",
"start": 831.395,
"end": 833.013
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Soot from fires all over the world, and dust from the impact, cover the whole sky.",
"start": 833.321,
"end": 838.959
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Sunlight can't get through.",
"start": 839.266,
"end": 840.717
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Plants can't grow.",
"start": 840.941,
"end": 842.381
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And it gets cold.",
"start": 842.688,
"end": 843.771
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Scientists think this impact winter lasted months.",
"start": 844.079,
"end": 846.97
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Maybe years.",
"start": 847.271,
"end": 848.164
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "The world gave you one gift on its last day.",
"start": 848.472,
"end": 851.218
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Fire.",
"start": 851.526,
"end": 852.14
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You carried an ember in from the burning forest.",
"start": 852.441,
"end": 854.741
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You keep a small fire right at the gap, never deep inside.",
"start": 855.049,
"end": 858.8
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "In a closed tunnel, smoke kills quietly.",
"start": 859.108,
"end": 862.423
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And at night, Pip sleeps against your neck.",
"start": 862.731,
"end": 865.354
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Two small bodies, keeping each other warm.",
"start": 865.662,
"end": 868.664
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The phone won't turn on anymore.",
"start": 869.001,
"end": 870.82
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The pen is dry.",
"start": 870.899,
"end": 871.892
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "So you scratch lines on the tunnel wall with a sharp stone.",
"start": 872.093,
"end": 874.94
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Inventory.",
"start": 875.248,
"end": 876.119
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Days after the end: 40.",
"start": 876.353,
"end": 878.039
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Still dark.",
"start": 878.347,
"end": 879.05
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dried fish: 7.",
"start": 879.204,
"end": 880.912
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Running low.",
"start": 881.066,
"end": 881.781
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero.",
"start": 882.668,
"end": 884.487
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Friends: one.",
"start": 884.641,
"end": 885.97
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 886.124,
"end": 887.664
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "You repeat the rules to yourself.",
"start": 888.001,
"end": 889.854
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 890.162,
"end": 891.155
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay near water.",
"start": 891.309,
"end": 892.391
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay underground.",
"start": 892.545,
"end": 893.673
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "And a new one, that no book ever taught you.",
"start": 893.981,
"end": 896.615
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small…",
"start": 896.923,
"end": 897.883
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "but don't stay alone.",
"start": 898.107,
"end": 900.183
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Small animals like Pip made it out of this darkness.",
"start": 900.519,
"end": 903.544
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Millions of years later, from small mammals like him, came horses, whales, apes.",
"start": 903.852,
"end": 910.047
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "And people.",
"start": 910.204,
"end": 911.153
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Sixty-six million years later, one of Pip's great-great-great-grandchildren is watching this video.",
"start": 911.461,
"end": 917.556
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "And just then, from outside the tunnel, a sound.",
"start": 917.892,
"end": 920.795
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "A bird, singing.",
"start": 921.737,
"end": 923.077
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "You cross out a line on the wall, and write it again.",
"start": 923.385,
"end": 925.908
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero…",
"start": 927.04,
"end": 929.172
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "except the birds.",
"start": 929.329,
"end": 931.037
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "On day one, what would you have done first?",
"start": 931.373,
"end": 934.276
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "Tell me in the comments.",
"start": 934.584,
"end": 935.924
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "And if you want to know what you and Pip did after the dark, tell me that too.",
"start": 936.232,
"end": 940.731
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 941.067,
"end": 941.837
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay alive.",
"start": 941.893,
"end": 942.942
}
]